    <string name="howto_1_text">Tap a cell, type with the keyboard. Tap the same cell again to switch across and down.</string>
    <string name="howto_2_title">Finish = check</string>
    <string name="howto_2_text">You get 5 checks per crossword. Finish checks the whole board: wrong letters turn red, fix them and finish again.</string>
